    "turn_text": "Well I don't think that they should be and the one thing that will be introducing this week myself and Dianne Feinstein is something to lift the prohibition to age 21. This shooter in Florida, 19 years old, was able to purchase an AK, or I'm sorry, an AR-15, when he couldn't purchase a handgun. I don't think you can explain why. Should have such ready access to an assault type weapon.",
