    "turn_text": "Yeah, so I grew up in a rural area and I don't want to to make criminals out of those who sell a 22 to their friend or something like that. I mean, but we can have restrictions. We do have restrictions. Age restrictions on handguns, for example. We have restrictions on automatic weaponry. You have to have an increased security level or go through additional hoops for that. So we have common",
