    "turn_idx": 397,
    "turn_text": "Nineteen members went to Africa with him, one Republican. And then Cuba went with him there, and I'd worked with his administration a lot on Cuba and went down with Patrick Leahy to do the spy swap. that triggered the normalization of relations. We talked, he called me after the shooting to make sure I was all right. After I gave my speech, he called, and the nicest thing he did, I think, is the last night he was in the White House. Day before inauguration he called and just to say that he'd enjoyed working with me ah and Certainly said the same he didn't have to do that. It was very nice",
