    "turn_idx": 427,
    "turn_text": "You know, that's tempting, certainly. But when you run a campaign, it's not just you. You've got to get volunteers and staff, and you've got to have donors. It's a whole effort. And to say to them, I'm not running to win. I'm just going to stand on principle, but we'll surely lose. And then, you know, that's not fair to them. And it's tough to build an organization like that. And I mean, I certainly felt I could have won a race had I simply been okay with the president and his policies and behaviors. But that was never in the cards. And I just, I can't run like that.",
