    "turn_text": "You certainly. You can't be around here very long, but understand that these institutions are durable and hopefully will endure. Whenever I speak to interns or other tourists or friends that come through, I hope you'll go home. and try to fend off the cynicism about this place. There are good people here on both sides of the aisle. And that's why I get so offended when the president or others refers to people on the Democratic side as losers or clowns that anybody uses that kind of vitriol that just feeds the cynicism that's already out there. This is a good place. And these institutions, I think, will endure. They're durable enough to withstand the foibles of",
